@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam monochrome true

actor "Port Authority Officer" as PAO
actor "Shipping Agent Representative" as SAR
actor "Logistics Operator" as LO
actor "Administrator" as Admin

rectangle "Port Management System" as PMS {
}

rectangle "Identity Provider\n(Google/Microsoft/Facebook)" as IDP
rectangle "Email Service" as Email


PAO --> PMS : Manages facilities,\napproves visits,\nmanages agents
SAR --> PMS : Submits vessel\nvisit notifications
LO --> PMS : Plans operations,\nallocates resources
Admin --> PMS : Manages users\nand permissions

PMS --> IDP : Authenticates users
PMS --> Email : Sends notifications

note right of PMS
  Core system for managing:
  - Port facilities (docks, storage)
  - Shipping agents & representatives
  - Vessel visits & cargo manifests
  - Resource allocation & scheduling
  - Task planning & execution
  - Operation execution management
end note

@enduml